  "traits": "Recommended Ability Score Increase: +2 Dex or Int, +1 Int or Cha (Int cannot be chosen as the +1 ASI, if it was chosen for the +2 ASI.)\nSpeed: 30 feet.\nSkill Proficiencies: Chakra Control, Stealth\nIce Release Affinity: You begin with either Wind or Water Release Affinity. (Pick one)\nIce Release Techniques: The Yuki Clan has access to a separate list of jutsu unique to their clan. You can add these Jutsu to your jutsu list instead of selecting jutsu from the normal jutsu list(s).\nHijutsu Flexibility: Yuki Clan Hijutsu can use either Dexterity or Intelligence as its casting ability score.\nCold Adjustment: Yuki Clansmen are immune to hostile cold environments and do not need to make checks or saving throws to resist effects caused by extreme cold temperatures.\nSlick Movement: Yuki Clansmen ignores difficult terrain and effects that would impede movement caused by jutsu with the Wind or Water Release keywords.",
